                   :fix "Vary the openers, e.g. :jack-out-creature 3: \"{name} first. Everything here holds still till you're back.\""}
                  {:where ":morning-brief line 1 \"items: {count}\"; :blueprint-ready lines 1, 4 \"blueprints: {count}\""
                   :rule 17
                   :issue "Label-colon-number reads like a form, not the warm voice of the estate. Rule 19 explicitly allows \"{count} items\"."
